{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:26 2026-05-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:36 2026-05-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:36 2026-05-28 HKT</p><p>大嶼山有人行山失蹤。一名52歲男子昨日（27日）早上出門，獨自前往鳳凰徑第8段行山，惟徹夜未歸家。至今日（28日）早上8時45分，其妻子發現他一直失去聯絡，於是報警求助。</p><p>警方及消防接報後在石壁郊遊徑集合，出發登山搜索，救護車亦到場戒備；而政府飛行服務隊已接獲相關通知。至下午約1時，人員在大嶼山狗嶺涌出動無人機協助搜索。</p><img alt=\"男子獨行鳳凰徑失去聯絡。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4d63bf06eab7c62a243e4ef987304141/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8ebe74ee073862a0a6849f0b7ace599b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/60c7d2c8a9498e0af43b9e29ea5659ba/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6bfa75c4a4cf081526c477e7a3d7098a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"救護車到場戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c03cf45551bd94a1a3ea8a585476ee5a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/223396c040d9909d6ea90a2afbe0557e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/676dd40a8fc2b05fc3870d593a48cc97/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_09.jpg\"/><img alt=\"人員在大嶼山狗嶺涌出動無人機協助搜索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f5d56cab7a4ebb0dffcf03681e494ba2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_10.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2ca12b218df11794b598056092049297/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6ea58d7ba327c0cc8a909f9dafd576d3/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_13.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/166ccb80238d11bef0d566046f2ef1c7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_15.jpg\"/><img alt=\"人員出動無人機協助搜索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/810952c57ddd7bebe212d5d68219664f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_17.jpg